e":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":16,"line":29,"offset":1611},"start":{"column":5,"line":29,"offset":1600}}}],"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":4,"line":30,"offset":1616},"start":{"column":28,"line":28,"offset":1593}}},"id":"b20e175b-e5d6-4e39-8627-76b81efa6f57","isOverride":false,"metadata":[],"name":"sumarPoderArmas","parameters":[],"problems":[],"scope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":4,"line":30,"offset":1616},"start":{"column":3,"line":28,"offset":1568}}},{"id":"8ed8001e-4698-44a6-b50d-db825faf4333","isConstant":false,"isProperty":false,"metadata":[],"name":"poder","scope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":12,"line":32,"offset":1631},"start":{"column":3,"line":32,"offset":1622}},"value":{"id":"1cfc1a77-24ed-4905-8ed7-7173e43f009a","metadata":[],"scope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"value":null}}],"metadata":[{"args":{"position":"start","text":"/*\r\nEl señor oscuro quiere recuperar su anillo (convengamos que es bastante llorón al respecto). \r\nEstá modelando un sistema en Wollok para representar los caminos de la Tierra Media, y nos ofreció\r\nmuy gentilmente la posibilidad de elegir entre darle una mano (la que medio le falta) o \r\nterminar en el fondo de Orodruin, también conocido como Monte del Destino. Su idea es la de representar\r\nalgunas cuestiones de la Tierra Media, para poder determinar dónde encontrar su anillo, de forma tal de poder \r\nllevarlo al lugar al que corresponde... que viene a ser su dedo, básicamente\r\n\r\nGandalf\r\nExisten diversos guerreros que pueden estar vagando por la Tierra Media, portando el anillo por ahí, como si nada estuviera pasando.\r\nUno de ellos es Gandalf “El Gris”, como se lo conoce normalmente (porque tiene varios nombres, \r\nvarían dependiendo a quien se le pregunte). Gandalf tiene un nivel de vida que es entre 0 y 100.\r\nLleva consigo ciertas armas, como su báculo y su espada, Glamdring.\r\nSu poder se calcula como:\r\n\tcantidad de vida * 15 + Sumatoria del Poder de sus Armas * 2\r\nEn el caso de que su vida sea menor a 10, la fórmula cambia de la siguiente manera:\r\n\tcantidad de vida * 300 + Sumatoria del Poder de sus Armas * 2\r\nEl báculo a Gandalf le otorga un poder fijo de 400. En el caso de la espada, el poder que otorga es de 10 veces \r\npor el valor dado por su origen, en este caso es élfico y vale 25. Si fuera enano, serían 20, y 15 en el caso humano.\r\n\r\n*/"},"name":"comment"}],"name":"gandalfGris","problems":[{"code":"malformedMember","sourceMap":{"end":{"column":1,"line":41,"offset":1787},"start":{"column":13,"line":32,"offset":1632}}}],"scope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"containerScope":{"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]},"contributions":{},"includedScopes":[]}]},"sourceMap":{"end":{"column":2,"line":41,"offset":1788},"start":{"column":1,"line":23,"offset":1473}},"supertypes":[]},"stack":"Error: Failed to print, found malformed node\n    at c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\node_modules\\wollok-ts\\dist\\printer\\print.js:26:15\n    at print (c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\node_modules\\wollok-ts\\dist\\printer\\print.js:19:7)\n    at c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\server\\out\\functionalities\\hover.js:24:50\n    at c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\server\\out\\server.js:198:20\n    at c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\server\\node_modules\\vscode-languageserver\\lib\\common\\server.js:590:20\n    at handleRequest (c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\server\\node_modules\\vscode-jsonrpc\\lib\\common\\connection.js:493:41)\n    at handleMessage (c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\server\\node_modules\\vscode-jsonrpc\\lib\\common\\connection.js:339:13)\n    at processMessageQueue (c:\\Users\\Lucas\\.vscode\\extensions\\uqbar.wollok-lsp-ide-0.3.4\\server\\node_modules\\vscode-jsonr